  {
   "id": "zh_ma",
   "title": "吗: yes or no questions",
   "intro": [
    "Put 吗 at the end of a statement and it becomes a yes or no question. There is no change in word order.",
    "你是学生 is 'You are a student.' Add 吗 and 你是学生吗？ asks 'Are you a student?'"
   ],
